{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29842","headline":"喜闻太原同院崔侍御台拜兼寄在台三二同年之什 · 李商隐","name":"喜闻太原同院崔侍御台拜兼寄在台三二同年之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹏鱼何事遇屯同，云水升沈一会中。\n刘放未归鸡树老，邹阳新去兔园空。\n寂寥我对先生柳，赫奕君乘御史骢。\n若向南台见莺友，爲传垂翅度春风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}